msgid "Update"
msgstr ""

msgid "Today, we released Quarkus 3.30."
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus 3.30 introduces the following notable changes:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/51043[#51043] - Introduce support "
"for `@JsonView` on the REST Client"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/50196[#50196] - Update to "
"Hibernate Validator 9.1"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/50332[#50332] - Add a CLI command "
"to decrypt secrets"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/50723[#50723] - OIDC token "
"propagation - allow users to select REST Client methods for which token "
"should be propagated"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/50806[#50806] - Support method-"
"level `@OidcClientFilter` bindings"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/50952[#50952] - Use "
"`@QuarkusIntegrationTest` tests as a test run for AOT file generation"
msgstr ""

msgid "As usual, this release also includes many bug fixes and improvements."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To update to Quarkus 3.30, we recommend updating to the latest version of "
"the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of "
"Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.30."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For more information about the adjustments you need to make to your "
"applications, please refer to the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/"
"Migration-Guide-3.30[Quarkus 3.30 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid "REST Client"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`@JsonView` support has been added to the REST Client.\n"
"You can now use this annotation on your REST Client interfaces to control "
"the serialization and deserialization of JSON data based on different views."
msgstr ""

msgid "This feature used to be only supported on the server side."
msgstr ""

msgid "Hibernate Validator"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Hibernate Validator has been updated to version 9.1, which comes with some "
"significant performance improvements."
msgstr ""

msgid "CLI"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A new `config decrypt` command has been added to the Quarkus CLI to decrypt "
"secrets that were encrypted using the `quarkus config encrypt` command."
msgstr ""

msgid "OIDC"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"OIDC token propagation has been enhanced to allow users to select specific "
"REST Client methods for which the token should be propagated."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Additionally, method-level `@OidcClientFilter` bindings are now supported, "
"allowing for more granular control over OIDC client behavior."
msgstr ""

msgid "AOT cache"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"`@QuarkusIntegrationTest` tests are now used as a test run for AOT file "
"generation."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get the full changelog of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/3.30.0.CR1[3.30.0.CR1], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/3.30.0[3.30.0], and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"releases/tag/3.30.1[3.30.1] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

